    name: "Populated pair: picker excludes types already valid",
    input: "drag Evidence → Claim (supports, opposes); click +; click Add existing… in the flyout",
    expected: "flyout closes; picker lists only accepted types not yet valid for Evidence–Claim (no supports/opposes)",
